# The Mine: cave floors, walls, rocks, ore and gem nodes, ladders, the lift (set=MINE).
# The cave floor is dark (index 3 everywhere), so a rock or node can use any palette whose darkest
# colour matches: plain rocks in SOIL/STONE, copper WOOD, gold ORANGE, gems CROP (recoloured in the mine
# to amethyst/emerald crystals by main.c). Walls are warm SOIL rock faces under a darker rock mass.

